WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Homemade Chai Spice Mix. 5 min · 1 servings · American

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ingredients: 6. 6 tablespoons ground cinnamon; 2 tablespoons ground cardamom; 2 tablespoons ground ginger; 1 tablespoon ground allspice

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1. Add all listed ingredients to an airtight container or jar.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2. Seal the jar and shake to combine.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3. Store on your spice rack at room temperature for up to 1 year.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
You're ready. Use Make It for checkboxes on the page.
